4,363 likes, 87 comments - drmarkhyman on October 31, 2026: "Can a cup of strawberries a day actually lower depression and improve memory? According to the clinical data, yes.

The compound is ellagic acid, a polyphenol concentrated in organic strawberries that directly reduces brain inflammation and feeds the gut bacteria responsible for producing anti-inflammatory signals. 

@drwilliamli explains how food reshapes your brain from the inside out. Find this full episode on The Dr. Hyman Show wherever you listen to podcasts!".

